<p>Israel expanded its military operations in Lebanon on March 4, stepping up airstrikes in and around Beirut and sending troops into southern border areas as clashes with Hezbollah intensified. One strike hit a hotel in Hazmieh, in Beirut’s suburbs—an attack several outlets described as a notable widening of targets around the capital. Lebanese officials reported deaths and injuries in the latest strikes, including in areas near Beirut and elsewhere in the country, as residents fled border communities amid ground crossings and evacuation orders.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/S0DU_GMfDPAzJVgtyYk3JGXqy3Vf-Y4sVzKlJ3YSl83y9_6xISspfnY6rwzQIweyVDzDzBhOwQ9F5aURoef3pnCdHb7pcLqelXZZlYhcGvPs21F7o49q7kQu0A0OHFHTX4zADdt7O-n7LvQMIAdbUJA7rORcqKhhl8nGfY5Q4m9tfWRtkFqxbU8_FUKgYjpNLgOqs0DaZzYuMtzY231kkG0lukTdcizc3Bm-VEhvwfVi79vRTOg5OdlM5p3_jvcprIXc-WHCgGLNOYuVJQ' alt='Smoke rises from Israeli airstrikes in Dahiyeh, a southern suburb of Beirut, on Tuesday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Incursion aim and scope: The Globe and Mail said Israel’s ground incursion aimed to push Hezbollah back from the border. Troops crossed into southern Lebanon at four locations, and evacuations were reported to affect about 80 villages near the frontier.</li><li>New Beirut-area geography: The Hindu described the Hazmieh hotel strike as the first reported Israeli attack on a predominantly Christian area in Beirut’s suburbs.</li><li>Baalbek deaths: A strike on a building in Lebanon’s Baalbek killed at least four people, part of what The Straits Times described as a sharp escalation since March 2.</li><li>Hotel damage detail: Guests told The Globe and Mail the strike hit the second floor of the Beirut-suburb hotel.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Lebanon’s health ministry: The ministry reported casualties from strikes on towns south of Beirut, including six killed and eight wounded in locations cited by Le Monde. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/04/israeli-strike-hits-beirut-hotel_6751078_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li><li>Israeli military (IDF): Israel said it launched a “broad wave of strikes,” according to Le Monde. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/04/israeli-strike-hits-beirut-hotel_6751078_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li><li>Hezbollah: RT reported Hezbollah saying it was ready for “open war” as cross-border fighting escalated. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/633759-israel-lebanon-incursion/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Hotel witnesses: Guests at the Beirut-suburb hotel told The Globe and Mail the strike hit the building without warning. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-hotel-in-beirut-hit-by-israeli-strike/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-war-israel-strikes-on-lebanon-hezbollah-beirut-march-4-2026/article70703102.ece'>Israel expands Lebanon strikes, killing 11</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-hotel-in-beirut-hit-by-israeli-strike/'>Hotel in Beirut hit by Israeli strike</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/at-least-four-killed-in-israeli-strike-on-building-in-lebanons-baalbek'>At least four killed in Israeli strike on building in Lebanon’s Baalbek</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/video/2026/03/04/lebanon-counts-dead-and-wounded-as-israeli-airstrikes-batter-beirut'>Lebanon counts dead and wounded as Israeli airstrikes batter Beirut</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/04/israeli-strike-hits-beirut-hotel_6751078_4.html'>Beirut hotel hit, six killed as Israel launches &#x27;broad wave of strikes&#x27;</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/633759-israel-lebanon-incursion/'>Israel extends Lebanon incursion to strike Hezbollah</a> - rt.com</li></ul>